  "body": "**Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.**\n\n<!-- A clear and concise description of what the problem is.\ne.g. I'm always frustrated when [...] -->\n\nI saw that arm64 support was recently added for linux, and since github actions now has [windows arm64 runner support](https://github.blog/changelog/2025-04-14-windows-arm64-hosted-runners-now-available-in-public-preview/) for public repos (`windows-11-arm`) would there be any appetite for supporting windows arm64 builds as well?\n\n**Describe the solution you'd like**\n\n<!-- A clear and concise description of what you want to\nhappen. -->\n\nSupport of native arm64 windows wheels and executable\n\n**Describe alternatives you've considered**\n\nNot sure if there is an alternative to the binary, but the pure python wheel could be an alternative to the native arm64 windows wheel.\n",
